## How to Run

### 1. Clone the Repository
```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/AionOS-Executive-Productivity-Agent.git
cd AionOS-Executive-Productivity-Agent
2. Create a Virtual Environment

Windows

python -m venv venv
venv\Scripts\activate

macOS / Linux

python3 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate
3. Install Dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt
4. Run the Application
streamlit run app.py

The application will open at:

http://localhost:8501
5. Run the Backend Separately
python executive_productivity_backend.py

Note: The current prototype does not require an OpenAI API key.
